Package: leaderstweets
Type: Package
Title: Access the Executive Social Media Database
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Juan", "Gomez Cruces", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "juansalvadorgc@gmail.com")
Description: Programmatic access to the Executive Social Media Database, a
    collection of 498,605 tweets and their engagement metrics from 62 heads of
    government and state across 34 countries between 2009 and 2023. Tables are
    downloaded from the project's API and cached locally, so a new data release
    is picked up without updating this package. Downloading a full table needs
    a free API key, which the project issues to researchers on request. The
    function names and arguments mirror the companion Python package
    'leaders_tweets'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/juangomezcruces/Executive-Social-Media-Database
BugReports: https://github.com/juangomezcruces/Executive-Social-Media-Database/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
